# The directory is committed; the key material is not.
#
# `frontend/Dockerfile` does `COPY certs/ /etc/nginx/certs/`, which fails the
# build outright when the folder does not exist in the checkout — so the folder
# has to be tracked. `docker-compose.yml` bind-mounts this same directory
# read-only, so `scripts/generate-certs.sh` (or your real certificate) drops the
# pair here and nothing needs rebuilding.
*
!.gitignore
